  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Code Her Future Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Code Her Future Kenya is not just about getting girls into technology and STEM -it&apos;s about equipping young vulnerable girls in Kenyan slums with the skills, knowledge, and confidence necessary to venture into and succeed in a previously male-dominated field. By delivering access to one-on-one and group lessons on coding, you&apos;ll help 100 vulnerable girls annually in Nairobi, Kenya, to complete their coding course and realize their full potential.</narrative>
  </description>
